### MEDUSA API — Team operations and captain transfer
### Run with VS Code REST Client. Execute requests in order.
### Organizer account must already have role="organizer" or "admin".
### Use an existing active organization and replace example credentials.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@organizationId = 1
@organizerEmail = organizer@example.com
@organizerPassword = replace-with-organizer-password
@memberEmail = team-member@example.com
@memberPassword = replace-with-member-password
@outsiderEmail = team-outsider@example.com
@outsiderPassword = replace-with-outsider-password
@teamName = MEDUSA-HTTP-Test-Team

### 1. Register member account (skip if it already exists)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{memberEmail}}",
  "password": "{{memberPassword}}"
}

### 2. Register outsider account (skip if it already exists)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{outsiderEmail}}",
  "password": "{{outsiderPassword}}"
}

### 3. Login as organizer
# @name organizerLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username={{organizerEmail}}&password={{organizerPassword}}

### 4. Login as member
# @name memberLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username={{memberEmail}}&password={{memberPassword}}

### 5. Login as outsider
# @name outsiderLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username={{outsiderEmail}}&password={{outsiderPassword}}

### 6. List active organizations
GET {{baseUrl}}/organizations

### 7. List teams for the organization
GET {{baseUrl}}/organizations/{{organizationId}}/teams

### 8. Create team; creator becomes captain
# @name createTeam
POST {{baseUrl}}/organizations/{{organizationId}}/teams
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerLogin.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "{{teamName}}"
}

### 9. Get public team details; verify response does not expose member emails
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{createTeam.response.body.$.id}}

### 10. Join team as member
# @name joinTeam
POST {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{createTeam.response.body.$.id}}/join
Authorization: Bearer {{memberLogin.response.body.$.access_token}}

### 11. Duplicate join by same member (expected 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{createTeam.response.body.$.id}}/join
Authorization: Bearer {{memberLogin.response.body.$.access_token}}

### 12. Non-member attempts captain transfer (expected 403)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{createTeam.response.body.$.id}}/captain
Authorization: Bearer {{outsiderLogin.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": {{createTeam.response.body.$.captain_user_id}}
}

### 13. Current captain attempts self-transfer (expected 409)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{createTeam.response.body.$.id}}/captain
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerLogin.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": {{createTeam.response.body.$.captain_user_id}}
}

### 14. Current captain transfers to non-member (expected 404)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{createTeam.response.body.$.id}}/captain
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerLogin.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 999999
}

### 15. Valid captain transfer to existing member
PUT {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{createTeam.response.body.$.id}}/captain
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerLogin.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": {{joinTeam.response.body.$.members[1].user_id}}
}

### 16. Former captain leaves after transfer (expected 204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{createTeam.response.body.$.id}}/leave
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerLogin.response.body.$.access_token}}

### 17. New captain cannot leave without transferring captaincy (expected 409)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{createTeam.response.body.$.id}}/leave
Authorization: Bearer {{memberLogin.response.body.$.access_token}}

### 18. Get team after leave
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{createTeam.response.body.$.id}}

### 19. Non-member attempts to leave (expected 404)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{createTeam.response.body.$.id}}/leave
Authorization: Bearer {{outsiderLogin.response.body.$.access_token}}

### 20. Unknown team details (expected 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/999999

### 21. Unknown organization team list (expected 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/organizations/999999/teams

### 22. Duplicate team name in same organization (expected 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/organizations/{{organizationId}}/teams
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerLogin.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "{{teamName}}"
}

### 23. Missing bearer token when creating a team (expected 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/organizations/{{organizationId}}/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "MEDUSA-Unauthenticated-Test"
}
